{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2781 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "101e3a4629adbce0f6342a5806a0440d5355020d364715a31ca91cd3d6fd41ab" :edb/db-before-t 2780 :edb/db-after-t 2781 :edb/tx-data [[13194139536093 50 #inst "2026-10-09T14:50:27.158Z" 13194139536093 true] [17592186119764 1020 #edb/ref 17592186383251 13194139536093 true] [17592186119764 1020 #edb/ref 17592186383265 13194139536093 true] [17592186119764 1020 #edb/ref 17592186383272 13194139536093 true] [17592186119765 1020 #edb/ref 17592186383258 13194139536093 true] [17592186120228 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536093 true] [17592186120228 1100 "Given that $Q(4, 0,-3)$ lies on the plane $Π: r \\cdot ⟨1,-4, 5⟩ =-11$, find the shortest distance from $P(-2, 1,-1)$ to $Π$." 13194139536093 false] [17592186120228 1100 "Given that $Q(4,0,-3)$ lies on the plane $Π:r\\cdot ⟨1,-4,5⟩=-11$, find the shortest distance from $P(-2,1,-1)$ to $Π.$" 13194139536093 true] [17592186120228 1145 "First, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨4,0,-3⟩-⟨-2,1,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨6,-1,-2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the equation of a plane, we get a normal vector $n=⟨1,-4,5⟩.$\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|6\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot (-4)+(-2)\\cdot 5|}{\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+(-4)^{2}+{5}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|6+4-10|}{\\sqrt{1+16+25}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\,0\\,|}{\\sqrt{42}} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point $P$ lies on the plane $Π.$" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383251 1017 #edb/ref 17592186383252 13194139536093 true] [17592186383251 1089 "q-129120" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383251 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139536093 true] [17592186383251 1100 "Given that $Q(5,-1,9)$ lies on the plane $Π:r\\cdot ⟨3,-6,-2⟩=3$, find the shortest distance from $P(7,-2,8)$ to $Π.$" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383251 1113 #uuid "780bb8b5-f350-5f18-b702-f18d3b60c284" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383251 1145 "First, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨5,-1,9⟩-⟨7,-2,8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,1,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the equation of a plane, we get a normal vector $n=⟨3,-6,-2⟩.$\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|(-2)\\cdot 3+1\\cdot (-6)+1\\cdot (-2)|}{\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+(-6)^{2}+(-2)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|-6-6-2|}{\\sqrt{9+36+4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|-14|}{\\sqrt{49}} \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{7} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383252 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383253 13194139536093 true] [17592186383252 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383254 13194139536093 true] [17592186383252 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383255 13194139536093 true] [17592186383252 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383256 13194139536093 true] [17592186383252 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383257 13194139536093 true] [17592186383252 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536093 true] [17592186383252 1041 "selection" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383252 1104 #edb/ref 17592186383254 13194139536093 true] [17592186383252 1110 #uuid "4a8dd7df-6ab1-5986-87a4-4cf5c94f9847" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383253 1034 "3" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383253 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383253 1111 #uuid "50a9c101-6040-5f1b-801d-2fbfe20bc200" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383254 1034 "2" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383254 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383254 1111 #uuid "63bf3027-e5e3-5155-a2ae-b3868a2b239d" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383255 1034 "1" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383255 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383255 1111 #uuid "c18299b4-08b7-5050-bdf0-67673df597ba" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383256 1034 "4" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383256 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383256 1111 #uuid "44c339db-5776-5817-80dc-407ee9a16d6e" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383257 1034 "5" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383257 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383257 1111 #uuid "ab946482-d5f1-5b8b-afec-fe7af533a64c" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383258 1017 #edb/ref 17592186383259 13194139536093 true] [17592186383258 1089 "q-129161" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383258 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536093 true] [17592186383258 1100 "Find the shortest distance between the point $P(-7,2,3)$ and the plane $Π$ with equation $4x+2y-4z=18.$" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383258 1113 #uuid "dbfa5b10-3396-56ab-981b-810a79db88a8" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383258 1145 "Let's start by picking a point on the plane. To do that, we simply substitute some concrete values for $x$ and $y$ into the equation and solve for $z.$ Let's choose $x=2$ and $y=1$ (though it doesn't really matter what values we choose). Solving for $z,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x+2y-4z & =18 \\\\ 4(2)+2(1)-4z & =18 \\\\ -4z & =8 \\\\ z & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we get the point $Q(2,1,-2)$ which lies on the plane.\n\nComputing $\\overset{\\to }{PQ},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨2,1,-2⟩-⟨-7,2,3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨9,-1,-5⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe also need a normal vector to the plane. For any Cartesian equation of a plane $ax+by+cz=d,$ the normal vector is $n=⟨a,b,c⟩.$ So, for the plane $Π,$ we have $n=⟨4,2,-4⟩.$ \n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|9\\cdot 4+(-1)\\cdot 2+(-5)\\cdot (-4)|}{\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-4)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|36-2+20|}{\\sqrt{16+4+16}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|54|}{\\sqrt{36}} \\\\  & =\\frac{54}{6} \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383259 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383260 13194139536093 true] [17592186383259 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383261 13194139536093 true] [17592186383259 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383262 13194139536093 true] [17592186383259 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383263 13194139536093 true] [17592186383259 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383264 13194139536093 true] [17592186383259 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536093 true] [17592186383259 1041 "selection" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383259 1104 #edb/ref 17592186383260 13194139536093 true] [17592186383259 1110 #uuid "7da30b26-2c11-5baa-adf7-a5c00c13bd1f" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383260 1034 "9" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383260 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383260 1111 #uuid "94ef919a-823b-59ff-afad-ca74c38e0ba1" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383261 1034 "8" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383261 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383261 1111 #uuid "1dcf7597-a454-509c-8439-d34e5faa06ab" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383262 1034 "7" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383262 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383262 1111 #uuid "232c692e-7823-5c98-ba0c-b7c3dacc80a1" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383263 1034 "6" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383263 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383263 1111 #uuid "740278ce-6c61-53ac-8e2c-70bd02d4dbf7" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383264 1034 "5" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383264 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383264 1111 #uuid "03f99c4d-1138-5e87-af97-3005e7eb72be" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383265 1017 #edb/ref 17592186383266 13194139536093 true] [17592186383265 1089 "q-80115" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383265 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536093 true] [17592186383265 1100 "Find the shortest distance between the point $P(-2,11,1)$ and the plane $Π$ with equation $r\\cdot ⟨2,-5,4⟩=20.$" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383265 1113 #uuid "f7b651ee-2f62-5743-a764-86bdae6d7be2" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383265 1145 "First, we need to find a point on the plane. If $r=⟨x,y,z⟩,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨2,-5,4⟩ & =20 \\\\ 2x-5y+4z & =20 \\\\ 4z & =20-2x+5y \\\\ z & =5-\\frac{1}{2}x+\\frac{5}{4}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting $x=2$ and $y=4,$ we get \n\n$$\nz=5-\\frac{1}{2}(2)+\\frac{5}{4}(4)=9.\n$$\n\nSo, the point $Q(2,4,9)$ lies on the plane. \n\nNow, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨2,4,9⟩-⟨-2,11,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,-7,8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the equation of a plane, we get a normal vector $n=⟨2,-5,4⟩.$\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|(4)\\cdot 2+(-7)\\cdot (-5)+8\\cdot 4|}{\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-5)^{2}+{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|8+35+32|}{\\sqrt{4+25+16}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|75|}{\\sqrt{45}} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383266 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383267 13194139536093 true] [17592186383266 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383268 13194139536093 true] [17592186383266 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383269 13194139536093 true] [17592186383266 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383270 13194139536093 true] [17592186383266 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383271 13194139536093 true] [17592186383266 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536093 true] [17592186383266 1041 "selection" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383266 1104 #edb/ref 17592186383270 13194139536093 true] [17592186383266 1110 #uuid "ab6f04e5-e374-58d3-a929-8a7e744125e1" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383267 1034 "55" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383267 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383267 1111 #uuid "077d3150-975a-51a9-9216-1a486213b1d6" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383268 1034 "\\sqrt{5}" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383268 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383268 1111 #uuid "daf22698-4613-5982-8786-c0d5ba6cad6e" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383269 1034 "15" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383269 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383269 1111 #uuid "c801d42b-7f0d-5c60-b475-a966bee05aa0" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383270 1034 "5\\sqrt{5}" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383270 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383270 1111 #uuid "a2c364af-a272-50a6-b30f-494f110bb9e4" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383271 1034 "5" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383271 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383271 1111 #uuid "243ec44e-50c3-5f68-80bc-c86f4f16c78c" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383272 1017 #edb/ref 17592186383273 13194139536093 true] [17592186383272 1089 "q-80116" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383272 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536093 true] [17592186383272 1100 "Find the shortest distance between the point $P(8,-6,5)$ and the plane $Π$ with equation $r\\cdot ⟨-8,6,3⟩=24.$" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383272 1113 #uuid "ad6c1785-45cd-5cbd-9ed7-53bd428209fc" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383272 1145 "First, we need to find a point on the plane. If $r=⟨x,y,z⟩,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨-8,6,3⟩ & =24 \\\\ -8x+6y+3z & =24 \\\\ 3z & =24+8x-6y \\\\ z & =8+\\frac{8}{3}x-2y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting $x=3$ and $y=1,$ we get \n\n$$\nz=8+\\frac{8}{3}(3)-2(1)=14.\n$$\n\nSo, the point $Q(3,1,14)$ lies on the plane. \n\nNow, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨3,1,14⟩-⟨8,-6,5⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-5,7,9⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the equation of a plane, we get a normal vector $n=⟨-8,6,3⟩.$\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|(-5)\\cdot (-8)+7\\cdot 6+9\\cdot 3|}{\\sqrt{(-8)^{2}+{6}^{2}+{3}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|40+42+27|}{\\sqrt{64+36+9}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|109|}{\\sqrt{109}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{109}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383274 13194139536093 true] [17592186383273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383275 13194139536093 true] [17592186383273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383276 13194139536093 true] [17592186383273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383277 13194139536093 true] [17592186383273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186383278 13194139536093 true] [17592186383273 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536093 true] [17592186383273 1041 "selection" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383273 1104 #edb/ref 17592186383278 13194139536093 true] [17592186383273 1110 #uuid "86fae567-a48e-54ef-bd62-a956ccedea23" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383274 1034 "11" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383274 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383274 1111 #uuid "f97ebe4d-2393-5387-9326-7180f29b6188" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383275 1034 "\\sqrt{10}" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383275 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383275 1111 #uuid "ade8f885-849c-50b8-8f22-88154f1240d4" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383276 1034 "10" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383276 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383276 1111 #uuid "95a80207-5a88-5a47-add0-733d1b6be8a1" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383277 1034 "0" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383277 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536093 true] [17592186383277 1111 #uuid "9ab2e938-3240-5910-a569-6e0752fb1f64" 13194139536093 true] [17592186383278 1034 "\\sqrt{109}" 13194139536093 true] [175921863832